d.mp4","videoBytes":154984,"duration":5.875},"b23cdc81d04d":{"text":"I can use it to access the internet.","id":"b23cdc81d04d","source":"BTS 25 · #9"},"41fa63b873d3":{"text":"I can communicate with my friends through online chatting.","id":"41fa63b873d3","source":"BTS 25 · #10","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/593c2532-60c7-42c5-b8dc-af185b1c9d2d.webp","imageBytes":10794},"d7f11d0d4746":{"text":"I don't know what I would do without my smartphone.","id":"d7f11d0d4746","source":"BTS 25 · #11"},"c243bfb8fca9":{"text":"Do you have a washing machine at home?","id":"c243bfb8fca9","source":"BTS 25 · #12"},"50fbda5172ea":{"text":"Which one is more efficient to use? Why?","id":"50fbda5172ea","source":"BTS 25 · #13"},"fd79b1b243ec":{"text":"What do you usually cook with the microwave?","id":"fd79b1b243ec","source":"BTS 25 · #14"},"33a3150b8dd8":{"text":"The zipper was invented in the late eighteen hundreds.","id":"33a3150b8dd8","source":"BTS 25 · #15","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/5e8d89e7-c13c-440f-a49a-411b69e5cb7a.webp","imageBytes":22342},"7e3f9bc14100":{"text":"People liked zippers because they were faster and easier to use than buttons.","id":"7e3f9bc14100","source":"BTS 25 · #16","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/e7d7288b-9902-4a01-892f-5e4cf0495843.webp","imageBytes":26700},"f7461707bbfa":{"text":"I think the stapler is a very useful invention.","id":"f7461707bbfa","source":"BTS 25 · #17","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/271cb320-f67b-4a55-a41c-a12c6baca0e7.webp","imageBytes":9734},"22d349bd1086":{"text":"Scissors are also very helpful. Students use them to cut things.","id":"22d349bd1086","source":"BTS 25 · #18"},"a050c430d7d3":{"id":"a050c430d7d3","source":"SIU Advance 1 · #66","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/fcb0e481-b730-47a0-b04c-58d95ea0df81.webp","imageBytes":16122},"82de8aca0528":{"text":"All inventions are useful; people just need to use them properly.","id":"82de8aca0528","source":"BTS 25 · #19"},"586ab5bcf26a":{"text":"What do you think is the greatest invention ever?","id":"586ab5bcf26a","source":"BTS 25 · #20","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/ac5d2af5-4093-41b4-84a5-f89ff7e85688.webp","imageBytes":26310},"e6f6a0325c1e":{"text":"The internet has changed how we communicate.","id":"e6f6a0325c1e","source":"BTS 25 · #21"},"2405975c3791":{"text":"Email allows us to send messages instantly around the world.","id":"2405975c3791","source":"BTS 25 · #22","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/4c30ad44-49c9-4307-bc41-85cab733ec18.webp","imageBytes":8614},"bb76da1e124c":{"text":"Video calls let us see and talk to people far away.","id":"bb76da1e124c","source":"BTS 25 · #23"},"a0fbbd7f0e70":{"text":"Social media helps us stay connected with friends and family.","id":"a0fbbd7f0e70","source":"BTS 25 · #24"},"fe7fce0d234b":{"id":"fe7fce0d234b","source":"SIU Basic 2 · #28","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/1d478d38-807e-4727-8e62-b03b99803489.webp","imageBytes":12944,"video":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/3d02ae8c-7cd8-4d61-8e45-902f10c93678.mp4","videoBytes":262134,"duration":5.875},"feb377fedaea":{"text":"Without electricity, many inventions would not work.","id":"feb377fedaea","source":"BTS 25 · #25"},"0ed596e334dc":{"text":"Thomas Edison improved the electric light bulb.","id":"0ed596e334dc","source":"BTS 25 · #26"},"6eeeec967b18":{"text":"The light bulb was invented to replace candles and oil lamps.","id":"6eeeec967b18","source":"BTS 25 · #27","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/8864eea7-4332-4f89-a295-45c52b9f73b4.webp","imageBytes":13348},"0a3a8a6691d6":{"text":"Now almost every home has electric lights.","id":"0a3a8a6691d6","source":"BTS 25 · #28","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/7e0e9930-d360-4a89-8e4d-3ebeb7db5f93.webp","imageBytes":3946},"8acea37b8ffe":{"text":"The television was invented in the early twentieth century.","id":"8acea37b8ffe","source":"BTS 25 · #29","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/dd3ad3d9-e631-444d-8247-78eafeb9f4b8.webp","imageBytes":10516},"3903ce32f285":{"text":"Television brings news and entertainment into our homes.","id":"3903ce32f285","source":"BTS 25 · #30","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/122570a5-ad72-4460-9c3f-72603c6d22a1.webp","imageBytes":10004},"ef4aa6ac57c8":{"id":"ef4aa6ac57c8","source":"BTS 21 · #18","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/317f89fd-cd7e-44d8-9859-183d323f600a.webp","imageBytes":16012,"video":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/b011d0c0-b20e-4023-84d0-7a150821fd07.mp4","videoBytes":501386,"duration":5.875},"7897181bb425":{"text":"Do you watch television every day?","id":"7897181bb425","source":"BTS 25 · #31"},"8a9e59b7d5ea":{"text":"What is your favorite television program?","id":"8a9e59b7d5ea","source":"BTS 25 · #32"},"f495cf10b724":{"text":"The car was invented to replace horse-drawn carriages.","id":"f495cf10b724","source":"BTS 25 · #33","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/c898cb18-f5ab-48e9-935c-95a127cadba2.webp","imageBytes":28674},"ae63d1406efc":{"id":"ae63d1406efc","source":"BTS 19 · #23","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/d796d35e-597f-4387-b8ed-9ae345aedd6d.webp","imageBytes":25386,"video":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/ebe594b5-0e8a-4577-aeb2-57b5ba7be26d.mp4","videoBytes":293358,"duration":5.875},"3a4569d86fda":{"text":"Cars have made transportation faster and more convenient.","id":"3a4569d86fda","source":"BTS 25 · #34"},"94c82f0d4bbf":{"text":"Have you ever taken a long car trip?","id":"94c82f0d4bbf","source":"BTS 25 · #35"},"7de42c8062db":{"text":"The airplane allows us to travel long distances quickly.","id":"7de42c8062db","source":"BTS 25 · #36"},"a36e58ea683e":{"text":"Modern airplanes can fly all around the world.","id":"a36e58ea683e","source":"BTS 25 · #37","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/00e08bdc-642b-44bb-8db8-62ffc782137d.webp","imageBytes":7142},"46375fa80813":{"id":"46375fa80813","source":"BTS 18 · #11","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/f37b8656-2407-4dd1-a85d-191e39dfd693.webp","imageBytes":49940,"video":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/64f43070-88b2-4752-88cd-f83c6eaaf340.mp4","videoBytes":320050,"duration":5.875},"4684a7f30042":{"text":"Flying is faster than driving for long distances.","id":"4684a7f30042","source":"BTS 25 · #38","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/51d59ecc-aca4-4f7a-8cc8-c03582e01d24.webp","imageBytes":7074},"60ded1f75e1d":{"text":"The refrigerator keeps food fresh for longer periods.","id":"60ded1f75e1d","source":"BTS 25 · #39","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/ed7d096f-069a-44ca-8468-67c6a61dfb27.webp","imageBytes":12102},"da6455d5ac90":{"text":"Before refrigerators, people had to cook fresh food every day.","id":"da6455d5ac90","source":"BTS 25 · #40","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/8e790dcb-5eeb-4ef7-9215-b7cbeb5cf7ec.webp","imageBytes":19938},"fc5c241d199c":{"text":"The microwave heats food very quickly.","id":"fc5c241d199c","source":"BTS 25 · #41","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/da9e3ac0-b7e2-4244-aca7-b9ef9f2c130e.webp","imageBytes":6974},"efa9730ceeb6":{"text":"Many people use microwaves to reheat leftovers.","id":"efa9730ceeb6","source":"BTS 25 · #42","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/49872f8d-4f0d-4364-86c8-64cbca92b4a6.webp","imageBytes":12442},"fa74f38687d9":{"text":"The dishwasher saves time and water compared to washing by hand.","id":"fa74f38687d9","source":"BTS 25 · #43","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/40049523-7e14-47e2-b16d-ced46b240663.webp","imageBytes":15994},"d92b9ac59edf":{"text":"Modern kitchens have many helpful electrical inventions.","id":"d92b9ac59edf","source":"BTS 25 · #44","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/4b082e7b-33bd-41be-be64-5ff251ef7916.webp","imageBytes":7384},"7d67b04b4771":{"text":"The printing press was invented in the fifteen hundreds.","id":"7d67b04b4771","source":"BTS 25 · #45"},"d55d464801bb":{"text":"The printing press made books cheaper and more available to everyone.","id":"d55d464801bb","source":"BTS 25 · #46"},"25183a761516":{"text":"Before printing presses, books were copied by hand.","id":"25183a761516","source":"BTS 25 · #47","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/236d4cd0-701e-4434-aed3-07221894e066.webp","imageBytes":12540},"f8f9c17f2cb8":{"text":"The camera allows us to capture and save memories.","id":"f8f9c17f2cb8","source":"BTS 25 · #48","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/16c273a1-adaa-4006-b582-b275a6fc30b4.webp","imageBytes":19776},"8248c56fa53b":{"text":"Photography has become an important form of art.","id":"8248c56fa53b","source":"BTS 25 · #49"},"d048e8f62a8d":{"text":"Digital cameras are now more popular than film cameras.","id":"d048e8f62a8d","source":"BTS 25 · #50","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/16c273a1-adaa-4006-b582-b275a6fc30b4.webp","imageBytes":19776},"3d379bd1dad6":{"text":"The clock helps us keep track of time.","id":"3d379bd1dad6","source":"BTS 25 · #51"},"b4f55f833936":{"text":"Without clocks, it would be hard to organize our day.","id":"b4f55f833936","source":"BTS 25 · #52","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/848fe647-ae9c-4aa1-ae04-ed656a104d21.webp","imageBytes":17232},"ce2a9d5ae2a8":{"text":"Watches are portable clocks that we can wear.","id":"ce2a9d5ae2a8","source":"BTS 25 · #53"},"3684d1c390e7":{"text":"The compass helped explorers navigate the world.","id":"3684d1c390e7","source":"BTS 25 · #54","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/d0b3adfe-48cf-4bfa-bf97-1d5a171f4080.webp","imageBytes":23414},"045b0eb9e25b":{"text":"Ships used compasses to find their direction at sea.","id":"045b0eb9e25b","source":"BTS 25 · #55","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/67812900-855c-4116-b152-8d8036bcf667.webp","imageBytes":15536},"8f96ba81a151":{"text":"The telescope allows us to see distant objects in space.","id":"8f96ba81a151","source":"BTS 25 · #56"},"f0cdafe2dc13":{"text":"Galileo used the telescope to study the planets.","id":"f0cdafe2dc13","source":"BTS 25 · #57","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/0525df66-c0fd-4af7-a084-fdf12949fabc.webp","imageBytes":7434},"d934a69164b7":{"text":"The microscope helps us see very tiny things.","id":"d934a69164b7","source":"BTS 25 · #58","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/746259e3-9837-4ed6-8b99-0abce2a84007.webp","imageBytes":9074},"98e2cb4f207f":{"id":"98e2cb4f207f","source":"SIU Advance 2 · #61","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/e6d76a19-de58-4233-97cd-78dbcd1d9267.webp","imageBytes":19660},"f551308221c3":{"text":"Scientists use microscopes to study bacteria and cells.","id":"f551308221c3","source":"BTS 25 · #59","image":"https://d2o