S 25 · #81","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/dd21619e-d2bf-4600-bb55-270fcb175eaa.webp","imageBytes":13400},"f67a52a1eeca":{"text":"The solar panel converts sunlight into electrical energy.","id":"f67a52a1eeca","source":"BTS 25 · #82"},"c937d7fabc45":{"text":"Solar panels are becoming more popular as a renewable energy source.","id":"c937d7fabc45","source":"BTS 25 · #83","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/8a943240-0ac2-415c-be85-5cf76e073ecc.webp","imageBytes":23174},"04d652903519":{"text":"The wind turbine generates electricity from wind power.","id":"04d652903519","source":"BTS 25 · #84","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/ea4e1f2c-015d-44f9-87c9-b487ca8cd91d.webp","imageBytes":3060},"3fb1bed0d721":{"text":"Wind turbines are found in many countries around the world.","id":"3fb1bed0d721","source":"BTS 25 · #85","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/1135fb90-a48e-4d56-926b-d6b5afca19d9.webp","imageBytes":14452},"f3674546638d":{"text":"Inventions continue to improve our quality of life.","id":"f3674546638d","source":"BTS 25 · #86","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/8d8a0eda-6784-40c6-90dc-d06129e7a245.webp","imageBytes":21886},"5c8180243585":{"id":"5c8180243585","source":"SIU Advance 1 · #55","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/c18b9465-9012-4f0d-91dc-bbfd6536e365.webp","imageBytes":15982},"fcf4c04651c2":{"text":"New inventions are created every year by engineers and scientists.","id":"fcf4c04651c2","source":"BTS 25 · #87","image":"https://d2ol7oe51mr4n9.cloudfront.net/user_3GD1yS6zlj6afu2oFQqivYqvn7k/ddeec389-19cc-446f-be2c-9101093cfda7.webp","imageBytes":20122},"6c87965576a4":{"text":"The future will likely bring even more amazing inventions.","id":"6c87965576a4","source":"BTS 25 · #88"},"ac30e4c1b1d2":